  - The pcsx-redux and nugget (psyqo) authors, for their PS1 homebrew tools.
    https://github.com/pcsx-redux/nugget
    https://github.com/grumpycoders/pcsx-redux
  - Everyone behind the PS5 homebrew scene: the SDK, etaHEN and the tools this runs on.

